Package: gsm.vizr
Title: R Wrapper for the gsm.viz Bar Chart Renderers
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michal", "Kaminski", , "michkam89@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0850-9939")),
    person("Gilead Sciences", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: An htmlwidgets interface to the gsm.viz JavaScript library
    generic bars and facetBars renderers. Provides spec construction and
    validation, a stable R-to-JavaScript serialization contract, click and
    selection events, Shiny bindings with proxy update verbs, and a shared
    HTML dependency for other packages custom widgets.
